# 统一两台电脑间的换行符行为，避免 autocrlf 差异造成假改动 / 脚本失效
# 文本文件统一按 LF 入库、LF 检出；bat 用 CRLF（cmd 对 LF 的 goto/label 解析有坑）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件禁止任何转换
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.pdf binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
